<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06019001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06019002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
