<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06019003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body inside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Underbody: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install wheel house outer panel (1), rear wheel house front reinforcement (2) and blind spot sensor bracket (3) (if equipped).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
